WEBVTT

00:21.800 --> 00:23.720
[Nanno] Adults say that a school

00:24.320 --> 00:26.480
is a safe space,

00:29.040 --> 00:30.240
an innocent place.

00:34.000 --> 00:34.840
DIARY OF GOOD DEEDS

00:38.800 --> 00:41.800
A community free from violence.

00:43.520 --> 00:45.880
However, the violence outside…

00:46.520 --> 00:48.800
-will always find its way to places…
-[girl screams]

00:48.880 --> 00:50.240
[Nanno] …it doesn't belong.

00:50.320 --> 00:54.360
-[vicious stabbing]
-[students screaming]

00:54.440 --> 00:55.680
Don't you agree?

00:55.760 --> 00:57.760
[theme music]

02:09.400 --> 02:11.840
[clock ticking]

02:23.920 --> 02:25.800
Why are you always slacking off, huh?

02:25.880 --> 02:27.320
Finish your work right now.

02:27.400 --> 02:28.880
I have other things to do, got it?

02:29.440 --> 02:32.000
That sounds like a "you" problem,
not mine.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.400
Wait.

02:36.480 --> 02:37.600
If you hit me with that,

02:38.080 --> 02:39.640
I will report you to the PTA.

02:39.720 --> 02:40.960
I'll tell them what you did.

02:42.680 --> 02:43.520
[sighs]

02:43.600 --> 02:46.320
[chuckles]
What is this here? Come on.

02:47.200 --> 02:48.960
Are you scared of the PTA?

02:50.440 --> 02:53.360
If that's how you feel,
we'll just stay here, yeah?

02:53.840 --> 02:56.600
You won't be the only one
that doesn't get to go home.

02:57.160 --> 02:58.360
No one goes home.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.040
No fair.

03:01.160 --> 03:04.160
It's his problem, not mine.
I can't stay here.

03:04.240 --> 03:06.360
I have a student council meeting.

03:06.440 --> 03:09.560
Me too. I have to go home
to edit my YouTube videos

03:09.640 --> 03:11.160
which I upload every Tuesday.

03:11.240 --> 03:14.040
If you want to leave,
tell Koh to finish his work.

03:14.120 --> 03:16.080
I wanna go home, too.
My daughter's waiting.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.120
Koh.

03:18.120 --> 03:19.400
Koh, just do your work.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.520
If I don't, what are you gonna do?

03:21.080 --> 03:23.080
Then just give it to me. Come on.

03:23.160 --> 03:24.080
No way.

03:24.600 --> 03:25.880
He has to do it.

03:28.600 --> 03:30.560
Koh, do it now.

03:31.360 --> 03:33.040
Come on. Do it for us.

03:34.560 --> 03:36.440
Fine. I'll do some work for you.

03:36.920 --> 03:38.120
I'll do this one for you, Kaew.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.320
I will do this one for you, Duang.

03:40.880 --> 03:41.840
And I'll answer…

03:42.520 --> 03:44.520
this third question for his daughter.

03:45.400 --> 03:47.240
-Daddy!
-Tang!

03:49.520 --> 03:50.960
Well, I don't need to do it for her now.

03:51.040 --> 03:52.320
His daughter is here.

03:53.720 --> 03:56.000
That freakin' kid came in
at the worst time.

03:56.080 --> 03:58.720
-Daddy, can I play a game on your phone?
-Here.

03:58.800 --> 03:59.920
Look at that.

04:00.000 --> 04:02.720
If she gets to play games here,
I'm not doing shit.

04:03.280 --> 04:04.280
Hey, Koh.

04:11.840 --> 04:13.240
[panting]
[Boong] Close the door.

04:13.320 --> 04:14.280
[panting]

04:14.360 --> 04:16.120
-Close the door!
-What on earth are you doing?

04:16.200 --> 04:18.000
-[Boong] Just close the door.
-[Koh] What the hell?

04:18.079 --> 04:19.600
Get out of the way.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.000
-[both panting]
-What's going on?

04:21.079 --> 04:22.400
What the hell is going on?

04:22.480 --> 04:24.400
-Close the door.
-Close the door.

04:25.000 --> 04:26.600
[Sa] Close the door!

04:32.400 --> 04:33.640
[door closes]

04:34.280 --> 04:35.560
[panting]

04:35.640 --> 04:36.920
[Tor] What's going on?

04:37.960 --> 04:39.600
-What happened?
-I don't know.

04:40.120 --> 04:41.760
We heard someone was attacking the school.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.520
[Suer] They're wearing our uniform
and stabbing people.

04:44.600 --> 04:46.320
-We ran here to get away.
-[Koh] What?

04:46.400 --> 04:47.440
That's not true, Suer.

04:47.520 --> 04:49.640
Yes, I swear. I saw it with my own eyes.

04:49.720 --> 04:53.400
A kid was stabbed in the throat
over and over, and over.

04:54.160 --> 04:55.920
I also heard that someone
got their face slashed.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.320
How many of them are there?

04:57.400 --> 04:58.760
[Boong] I don't know.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.440
Hang on. Just calm down.

05:02.320 --> 05:03.920
Move the desks over here, hurry!

05:04.000 --> 05:04.920
We'll block the door.

05:08.360 --> 05:09.600
[Tor] Stop.

05:09.680 --> 05:10.880
Do it quietly.

05:11.560 --> 05:13.320
Do you want them to hear us, huh?

05:14.320 --> 05:16.200
Turn off the lights and close the shades.

05:17.440 --> 05:19.200
[clattering]

05:23.720 --> 05:25.680
Keep it quiet. Keep it quiet.

05:27.840 --> 05:30.880
Koh! What are you doing?
Grab a desk and help.

05:40.760 --> 05:42.040
Everyone, sit over here.

05:44.120 --> 05:48.000
Keep as quiet as you can
so they don't know where we are, okay?

05:50.560 --> 05:52.240
Do I still need to finish my homework?

05:53.680 --> 05:54.880
Hey, Koh.

05:55.840 --> 05:56.960
I'm just curious.

05:57.440 --> 05:58.520
He was so serious.

05:58.600 --> 06:01.040
Stop it, Koh. Can you shut the fuck up?

06:01.120 --> 06:03.880
The prisoner will hear you
and come and kill us all.

06:03.960 --> 06:05.880
Have you all lost your fucking minds?

06:05.960 --> 06:08.240
You really believe what these two liars
are saying to you?

06:08.800 --> 06:11.200
If you don't believe us,
go and see the carnage for yourself.

06:12.440 --> 06:13.440
This is bullshit.

06:18.160 --> 06:20.040
-[clanks]
-[principal] Attention everyone.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.080
All students and faculty.

06:22.680 --> 06:24.840
There is an emergency
on the school premises.

06:25.400 --> 06:28.080
A serial killer convicted of eight murders
has escaped from prison

06:28.160 --> 06:29.800
and is attacking students.

06:29.880 --> 06:32.720
The prisoner is wearing our school uniform

06:33.320 --> 06:35.520
and has already injured
three of our students.

06:36.320 --> 06:38.640
I want everyone to remain calm.

06:39.280 --> 06:42.480
And stay in groups
until the next announce--

06:42.560 --> 06:44.880
-[clattering]
-[speaker screeching]

06:49.320 --> 06:50.640
[exhales deeply]

06:50.720 --> 06:52.720
[foreboding music]

07:02.080 --> 07:03.360
Are the prisoners gone?

07:05.200 --> 07:06.720
How am I supposed to know that?

07:07.400 --> 07:09.240
'Cause I saw you using your phone.

07:09.320 --> 07:12.120
I'm trying to call for help,
but it's not working.

07:14.040 --> 07:16.680
There's no fucking reception
at the school today.

07:19.160 --> 07:20.720
Can you get through to anyone?

07:21.840 --> 07:23.320
-I can't at all.
-Does it work?

07:23.920 --> 07:25.240
[Duang] I can't either.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.080
I found something…

07:30.680 --> 07:31.880
about the murderer.

07:31.960 --> 07:33.480
What does it say?

07:33.560 --> 07:35.200
The news says,

07:35.280 --> 07:36.560
"A typical Friday morning

07:36.640 --> 07:39.080
has turned into a day of tragedy
at one of our city's

07:39.160 --> 07:41.480
most prestigious private schools.

07:41.560 --> 07:44.240
Law enforcement officials have yet
to release a statement

07:44.320 --> 07:47.240
but sources within the building report
that a young woman,

07:47.320 --> 07:50.640
a recent graduate of the school,
returned with a murderous vendetta.

07:50.720 --> 07:53.440
The unidentified female
is said to be walking around

07:53.520 --> 07:56.000
smiling and carrying a black bag.

07:56.080 --> 07:59.160
She has been using a knife
to stab multiple victims

07:59.240 --> 08:01.400
-over and over and over again."
-Tang, don't be scared.

08:01.480 --> 08:03.520
-It's gonna be okay. Stop it!
-[Nanno] "The story--"

08:06.240 --> 08:07.720
Did they post a picture of her?

08:08.560 --> 08:09.960
It's still loading on mine.

08:17.080 --> 08:19.240
Hey, hey. Wi sent me a message.

08:20.840 --> 08:22.520
She said the murderer is in building one.

08:23.200 --> 08:24.440
What else did she say?

08:25.800 --> 08:29.040
She said the murderer
is coming to building four.

08:29.640 --> 08:32.679
-But that's our building, Dad.
-Quiet. Quiet.

08:32.760 --> 08:34.120
Are you making this up, Boong?

08:34.200 --> 08:35.440
No. Look at it yourself.

08:37.039 --> 08:37.960
[Sa] Hey.

08:39.159 --> 08:41.600
My friend said she's on her way
to our floor right now.

08:42.440 --> 08:43.480
Damn it.

08:44.000 --> 08:46.960
Anyone whose phone works,
try to text the police to come help us.

08:47.920 --> 08:49.840
-It won't send at all.
-What?

08:49.920 --> 08:51.280
Can you send a text?

08:51.360 --> 08:53.840
-I can't send a text, either.
-No. It won't let me.

08:54.480 --> 08:56.880
What should we do, Daddy? I'm scared.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.360
[Tor] It's okay.
[shushes]

08:58.440 --> 09:00.720
Tang, It's okay, baby.
Listen, everything's gonna be okay.

09:01.440 --> 09:03.440
[clattering in distance]

09:07.160 --> 09:09.000
[Tor] Shh. Just keep it down.
Keep it down.

09:09.080 --> 09:11.080
[muffled cries]

09:13.960 --> 09:16.280
-[sobbing]
-Keep quiet.

09:17.680 --> 09:19.560
[Tang whimpers]

09:19.640 --> 09:21.840
-[Tor] Keep quiet, Tang.
-Shut up, you little brat.

09:21.920 --> 09:23.280
They're going to hear us.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.080
Shut up. Don't order my kid around.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.760
[Boong] Both of you, shut up.

09:28.120 --> 09:30.120
[tense music]

09:30.680 --> 09:33.040
-[shushing]
-[Tang whimpering]

09:41.040 --> 09:44.040
[Tor] She's gone.
She's gone. We're safe now.

09:44.880 --> 09:46.600
[Sa] Are we safe now or not?

09:47.440 --> 09:49.640
I don't know. What are people saying?

09:50.960 --> 09:52.360
The reception is gone.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.600
Be quiet.

09:54.280 --> 09:56.160
I think I can hear something out there.

10:05.400 --> 10:06.760
Did she come back?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.240
Shut up, shithead.

10:09.240 --> 10:11.800
-[banging]
-[all screaming]

10:13.960 --> 10:16.520
[female student]
Open this door for us, please!

10:16.600 --> 10:19.400
-Help! Please!
-[doorknob clanking]

10:19.480 --> 10:21.680
Hey! Hey! Wait! Don't open it!

10:22.840 --> 10:24.600
-What are you doing?
-[Suer] What the hell?

10:25.760 --> 10:29.160
How can we know if she's a student
or the murderer trying to get us

10:29.240 --> 10:31.520
to open the door for them? We don't know.

10:31.600 --> 10:34.440
For our safety, I forbid you
to open the door to anyone.

10:35.040 --> 10:37.240
What if she's not the murderer,
but a student?

10:37.320 --> 10:38.840
Are you just gonna let her die out there?

10:38.920 --> 10:40.480
How can we know that?

10:40.560 --> 10:42.320
She might come in and kill us all!

10:42.400 --> 10:43.800
What if she's not?

10:43.880 --> 10:46.160
Will you let her die?
What kind of teacher are you, anyway?

10:46.640 --> 10:48.120
[scoffs]
I don't know.

10:48.200 --> 10:50.120
I'm not risking my daughter's life.

10:50.200 --> 10:52.960
You only care about your daughter.
What about the people out there?

10:53.600 --> 10:54.800
Then I'll let her in!

10:54.880 --> 10:56.400
-[grunts]
-[Tor] I said no!

10:56.480 --> 10:59.640
-I said no.
-Kaew! Open the door now!

10:59.720 --> 11:01.400
-[both grunt]
-I won't let you!

11:03.360 --> 11:05.200
[Koh] What? What is wrong with you?

11:05.280 --> 11:07.000
You could have hurt her
pushing her like that!

11:07.080 --> 11:08.200
I don't care.

11:08.280 --> 11:10.360
If I had to choose
between a student or my daughter,

11:10.440 --> 11:11.800
then I will protect my child.

11:11.880 --> 11:14.120
Doesn't the girl out there
need protecting, too?

11:14.800 --> 11:16.560
Shut the fuck up!

11:16.640 --> 11:18.400
-[Suer] Hey, stop.
-[Boong] Stop it!

11:19.480 --> 11:20.560
[panting]

11:20.640 --> 11:22.080
[Nanno] You guys can stop fighting.

11:28.160 --> 11:29.360
She's dead now.

11:30.040 --> 11:31.960
[students gasping]

11:38.200 --> 11:40.520
[all screaming]

11:40.600 --> 11:41.600
You're the real murderer!

11:41.680 --> 11:42.640
How am I a murderer?

11:42.720 --> 11:44.760
-Because of you she's dead.
-I helped you guys.

11:44.840 --> 11:46.080
How did you help us?

11:46.160 --> 11:47.120
Think about it.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.680
If we let the girl inside,

11:48.760 --> 11:50.160
the murderer would've come in, too.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.840
She would've already murdered all of you.

11:53.880 --> 11:56.480
What I did was sacrifice her

11:57.280 --> 11:58.480
to save all of us.

11:58.560 --> 11:59.880
Don't fucking say that!

12:01.160 --> 12:02.960
Admit it,
you are only thinking about Tang.

12:03.040 --> 12:04.320
You didn't think about us at all.

12:04.400 --> 12:06.200
-I did.
-Fucking liar.

12:06.280 --> 12:08.280
It's obvious that you only care
about your daughter.

12:10.160 --> 12:11.040
Just you wait.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.360
Once I get out of here,

12:12.440 --> 12:16.600
I will tell everyone how you abandoned
your students out there!

12:16.680 --> 12:18.400
No school will ever hire you.
Not ever again!

12:18.480 --> 12:19.480
Your career will be done.

12:20.240 --> 12:21.520
-Koh!
-What?

12:21.600 --> 12:22.800
Can you shut up?

12:23.760 --> 12:25.520
If the murderer is still outside,

12:26.000 --> 12:27.480
she could still come back to kill us.

12:27.560 --> 12:28.920
I think it's too late.

12:29.000 --> 12:31.320
She's probably waiting for us
right by the door.

12:32.520 --> 12:34.040
This is all your fault.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.120
Why didn't we run away from the school?

12:37.200 --> 12:38.720
Why did you bring us here, anyway?

12:39.280 --> 12:42.520
If you're so smart,
why don't you tell me where to go, huh?

12:44.120 --> 12:46.000
I'm grateful that we found the others.

12:46.080 --> 12:47.480
At least we won't die alone.

12:48.840 --> 12:50.440
I don't wanna die at all, okay?

12:50.920 --> 12:52.160
[Kaew] Can you please calm down?

12:52.640 --> 12:56.200
Did you not hear the principal saying
that everything will be fine?

12:57.360 --> 12:59.120
We don't even know if he's still alive.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.760
He's probably dead already.

13:01.840 --> 13:02.880
Come on, Koh.

13:02.960 --> 13:05.080
You heard the same thing I heard, right?

13:06.200 --> 13:08.800
He was talking,
then all of a sudden something happened.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.840
[Tor and Tang whispering prayers]

13:11.920 --> 13:14.000
[mumbling]

13:15.920 --> 13:18.320
[Koh] This teacher is fucking useless.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.880
He is the adult here,

13:19.960 --> 13:21.840
but he only cares about himself.

13:22.920 --> 13:24.480
How will a prayer help you now?

13:25.480 --> 13:28.120
Do you think God will come
and lead you both out of here?

13:28.200 --> 13:29.200
[Tor mumbling]

13:29.280 --> 13:31.840
Let me tell you, the only thing

13:31.920 --> 13:33.440
God can do at this point

13:33.520 --> 13:35.680
is escort you and your daughter to heaven.

13:37.040 --> 13:38.880
[breathing heavily]
You little son of a bitch.

13:38.960 --> 13:40.360
-[Sa] Koh, stop!
-[Koh] Fuck you!

13:40.440 --> 13:42.400
-[Suer] Hey!
-[Kaew] Calm down! Calm down!

13:42.480 --> 13:45.000
-How could you do that?
-[Kaew] Do you want to die? Fuck you!

13:45.080 --> 13:46.640
You guys can fight all you want!

13:46.720 --> 13:49.160
Go ahead and kill each other,
you stupid idiots!

13:50.160 --> 13:52.960
[clicking]

13:55.080 --> 13:56.360
Don't you think…

13:57.280 --> 13:59.720
we should find weapons
to protect ourselves?

14:00.680 --> 14:02.560
In case the murderer gets here.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.720
[sighs]

14:06.120 --> 14:07.160
Yeah.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.600
Right. What do we have?

14:11.800 --> 14:14.080
This shit is so useless.

14:17.840 --> 14:18.840
Shit.

14:19.440 --> 14:21.120
Hey, Tang, you want this?

14:23.520 --> 14:25.040
[Tor] Koh, I'm warning you.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.600
Sir.

14:27.120 --> 14:28.320
Do you want this?

14:29.720 --> 14:33.000
I saw on the news that a teacher
stabbed some students with a pen.

14:35.960 --> 14:38.120
I found a pair of scissors. You want them?

14:48.200 --> 14:50.360
[clattering]

14:55.240 --> 14:56.520
I found a box cutter.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.520
Who wants it?

14:59.040 --> 15:00.080
I'll take that.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.640
[cutter clicking]

15:04.800 --> 15:06.240
Of course, you'll take it…

15:06.320 --> 15:07.480
for yourself.

15:08.240 --> 15:10.160
I'm the oldest one in the room right now.

15:10.240 --> 15:12.840
I need the sharpest weapon
to protect all of you.

15:12.920 --> 15:15.080
Protect us like you did
that girl out there?

15:15.640 --> 15:16.800
You piece of shit.

15:18.240 --> 15:20.320
Suer, I found another box cutter.

15:22.400 --> 15:23.320
Here.

15:23.960 --> 15:26.120
You can have this. Okay?

15:27.200 --> 15:28.520
Find anything else?

15:31.080 --> 15:32.880
I found another metal pipe, Koh.

15:32.960 --> 15:33.960
Take it.

15:36.520 --> 15:37.560
Okay.

15:50.920 --> 15:52.920
[ominous music]

16:06.480 --> 16:08.480
Dad, I'm hungry.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.560
Does anyone have something to eat?

16:18.240 --> 16:19.280
[Tor] Anyone?

16:20.600 --> 16:22.560
I'm thirsty, too.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.200
Does anyone have water?

16:29.360 --> 16:30.440
Just give her some water.

16:30.520 --> 16:31.760
We don't have any.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.400
Don't lie to me.

16:34.160 --> 16:35.680
I know you've got some.

16:35.760 --> 16:37.160
Give her some water now!

16:37.240 --> 16:39.000
[Suer] I said we don't have any.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.800
I saw the look you two gave each other.

16:41.920 --> 16:42.920
Give the kid some water.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.400
I said we don't have any.

16:46.400 --> 16:47.760
Then I'll search your bag.

16:48.600 --> 16:49.840
-Give me this.
-[Suer] No. Hey!

16:55.680 --> 16:57.080
[clatters]

16:59.640 --> 17:01.080
[Suer] I told you we don't have any.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.520
[Tor] Just wait a little longer.

17:05.000 --> 17:07.240
We'll get some water
when we get out. Okay?

17:07.800 --> 17:08.680
[thuds]

17:09.240 --> 17:10.520
[Tor] Everything's gonna be okay.

17:10.599 --> 17:12.920
Koh! You drink our water?

17:13.000 --> 17:15.800
How's that? You said you didn't have any.

17:16.880 --> 17:19.440
You know, I was saving that
for my girlfriend.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.240
[Koh] What do you mean?

17:21.800 --> 17:23.359
But you said you didn't have any.

17:24.040 --> 17:26.200
Are you saying
that you lied to the kid? Really?

17:26.280 --> 17:28.119
To save water for your girlfriend?

17:28.200 --> 17:29.800
What kind of man are you?

17:34.960 --> 17:36.200
[burps]

17:42.800 --> 17:44.160
Do you think they're gone?

17:47.920 --> 17:48.800
[Duang] I don't know.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.400
I don't hear anything.

17:51.880 --> 17:53.040
I don't either.

17:53.520 --> 17:54.840
If she was still here,

17:55.360 --> 17:56.920
no one would be alive right now.

17:59.320 --> 18:00.520
Actually, I think that

18:01.080 --> 18:03.440
this might be our only chance
to get out of here

18:03.520 --> 18:04.520
before she comes back.

18:04.600 --> 18:05.760
You go ahead.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.720
Go and find someone to help get us out.

18:08.800 --> 18:09.640
[Kaew] I agree.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.520
If you think
this is our only chance to get out,

18:13.160 --> 18:14.480
then you can go.

18:14.560 --> 18:16.200
Do you expect me to go out there alone?

18:17.040 --> 18:20.200
I meant all of us could go out there
together so we could protect each other.

18:20.280 --> 18:22.320
We're gonna die if we all leave.

18:22.400 --> 18:24.080
Do you want me to go out there
to die alone?

18:24.160 --> 18:25.320
Oh, fuck off.

18:25.400 --> 18:28.280
You deserve to be the first
to go out and check, Koh.

18:28.360 --> 18:29.760
If it weren't for you,

18:29.840 --> 18:33.840
every single one of us would have left
before all of this went down.

18:33.920 --> 18:36.360
But because of you, we are stuck here.

18:36.440 --> 18:38.840
What? You're gonna blame me, yeah?

18:38.920 --> 18:41.560
Why don't you blame this on our fucking
teacher for giving us all detention?

18:41.640 --> 18:43.240
I did my job.

18:43.320 --> 18:44.840
You didn't do yours.

18:44.920 --> 18:48.200
Oh, great. Blame everything on me.

18:48.280 --> 18:50.040
I guess they should blame me as well then.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.560
I'm not blaming you, Koh.

18:56.280 --> 18:57.280
Then how about this?

18:58.200 --> 18:59.440
Let's take a vote

19:00.400 --> 19:01.960
on who should go first.

19:04.160 --> 19:05.720
If you think Koh should go,

19:06.640 --> 19:07.760
raise your hand.

19:11.680 --> 19:12.680
Sa.

19:13.280 --> 19:14.360
What are you doing?

19:16.640 --> 19:18.080
He shouldn't go out there alone.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.120
[Sa] I feel bad for him.

19:23.200 --> 19:24.760
This isn't the first time

19:25.560 --> 19:27.000
you stuck up for him.

19:28.080 --> 19:29.400
What's going on?

19:30.440 --> 19:32.840
Nothing. I don't want him to get hurt.

19:33.640 --> 19:34.720
[Suer] Are you sure?

19:37.000 --> 19:39.000
If it makes you feel better,
then I'll vote for Koh.

19:39.080 --> 19:40.200
Fuck off.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.080
How could you do that?

19:43.440 --> 19:45.000
Everyone voted for you to go.

19:45.640 --> 19:47.480
-Go on, get out.
-Do you really think

19:47.560 --> 19:48.920
that I'll go get help?

19:49.000 --> 19:50.560
If I get out of here, you'll see.

19:51.040 --> 19:53.800
If I get away,
I won't give a shit about any of you.

19:54.280 --> 19:56.040
Prepare to die in here.

19:56.120 --> 19:57.320
That's true.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.240
If all of you did that to me,

19:59.320 --> 20:00.960
I definitely wouldn't call
for help either.

20:01.040 --> 20:02.360
[Kaew] Let me ask you.

20:02.840 --> 20:03.880
Who are you?

20:04.560 --> 20:06.640
Why haven't we seen your face
at school before?

20:07.400 --> 20:08.600
Oh, I forgot.

20:09.400 --> 20:10.640
So, let's see.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.240
My name is Nanno.

20:12.320 --> 20:14.520
Today is my very first day here.

20:15.080 --> 20:18.040
I'm a new student in grade 11, class four.

20:19.280 --> 20:22.200
I also seem to have incredibly bad luck.

20:22.280 --> 20:23.960
On my first day of school,

20:24.480 --> 20:26.680
a psychopath escapes from prison.

20:28.520 --> 20:30.160
How about this, then?

20:30.240 --> 20:33.040
If you feel so bad for him,
then you can go with him.

20:33.120 --> 20:34.600
Both go find people to help us.

20:35.840 --> 20:37.240
Of course, I could go with him.

20:39.480 --> 20:41.200
But I still haven't figured out

20:41.760 --> 20:43.800
why I should get people
to help any of you.

20:48.520 --> 20:51.120
And the kid? You don't feel bad for her?

20:51.880 --> 20:54.000
How ironic that the one who lied

20:54.480 --> 20:57.000
and refused to give the kid any water

20:57.080 --> 20:59.400
is asking me to show sympathy.

20:59.480 --> 21:02.440
If we had to choose the one
most likely to come back and save us,

21:02.520 --> 21:04.080
wouldn't it be the adult here?

21:04.640 --> 21:06.960
Because he would have to come back
for his daughter.

21:07.040 --> 21:08.000
If I go out there,

21:08.080 --> 21:09.920
-I'm taking Tang with me--
-Also…

21:10.480 --> 21:11.960
you're a teacher.

21:12.040 --> 21:13.880
You're responsible for your students.

21:13.960 --> 21:14.960
Koh.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.680
I won't go anyways.

21:19.760 --> 21:21.400
Why not? You have a box cutter.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.480
You have one, too.

21:22.560 --> 21:24.320
Why don't we make Suer go?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.960
[Koh] That's a good idea.

21:26.040 --> 21:28.720
Suer would have to come back for Sa.

21:28.800 --> 21:31.360
I'm not going. I'm staying with Sa.

21:31.920 --> 21:35.320
Come to think of it,
isn't Kaew in the student council?

21:35.400 --> 21:37.160
Haven't you pledged to help
your fellow students?

21:37.720 --> 21:39.960
But I don't have anything to fight with.

21:40.040 --> 21:41.600
I'm happy to give you my cutter.

21:41.680 --> 21:42.760
-[sighs]
-That's enough.

21:42.840 --> 21:44.400
Stop changing the subject.

21:44.480 --> 21:47.160
Everyone voted for you to go,
so you have to go. Go!

21:47.720 --> 21:48.840
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

21:48.920 --> 21:50.040
-That's right.
-[Tor] Go.

21:50.120 --> 21:53.480
My ass. Listen to yourselves.
[scoffs]

21:53.560 --> 21:55.040
[Kaew] Whatever. We voted.

21:55.120 --> 21:58.040
You have to go
and find someone to rescue us now.

21:58.120 --> 21:59.680
If you're able to get us help,

22:00.480 --> 22:02.160
I'll make sure you pass this year.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.200
Oh.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.120
Is that how you wanna play?

22:05.200 --> 22:06.080
Yes.

22:15.680 --> 22:18.200
Fine. I'll go get help.

22:43.280 --> 22:44.880
-[door creaks]
-[Koh gasps]

22:46.920 --> 22:48.920
[foreboding music]

22:58.040 --> 22:59.200
Shit.

23:00.000 --> 23:01.120
[Suer] What is it?

23:01.840 --> 23:02.960
What?

23:03.760 --> 23:05.000
The body is gone.

23:06.680 --> 23:08.160
She came back to get the body.

23:08.640 --> 23:10.920
Fuck! We were too loud.

23:11.480 --> 23:12.880
She has to know that we're in here.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.880
We were arguing
because you wouldn't go for help.

23:15.960 --> 23:16.800
[Kaew] Koh.

23:17.440 --> 23:18.520
Listen to me.

23:19.000 --> 23:23.280
Maybe the body wasn't taken
by the murderer but by somebody else.

23:24.120 --> 23:27.280
The police might have come to investigate
without knowing that we were here.

23:27.360 --> 23:30.200
How could they not know? We were too loud.

23:31.640 --> 23:33.480
[exhales deeply]
I won't go.

23:34.480 --> 23:36.240
[Kaew] If you won't go,
then what's your plan?

23:36.800 --> 23:38.240
You're just gonna sit there?

23:38.720 --> 23:40.160
[Koh] That's exactly what I'm doing.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.040
If we keep quiet for 15 minutes,

23:52.520 --> 23:53.720
then I'll go, okay?

23:54.320 --> 23:56.760
[clock ticking]

24:04.280 --> 24:06.280
[tense music]

24:56.280 --> 24:57.840
Someone open the door for me.

25:15.200 --> 25:16.240
The door.

25:16.760 --> 25:18.320
You want me to get help, right?

25:37.960 --> 25:39.160
[Kaew whimpers]

25:39.720 --> 25:41.080
-[Tor] Koh!
-[screaming]

25:41.160 --> 25:42.080
-[Boong] Hey!
-[Duang] Kaew!

25:42.720 --> 25:45.360
-[Suer] What are you doing?
-[Kaew] Koh! What the fuck are you doing?

25:45.440 --> 25:46.920
Let me in right now.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.680
Weren't you the one who said that

25:48.760 --> 25:50.960
the body is gone
because the police were here?

25:51.040 --> 25:52.160
[doorknob clanking]

25:52.240 --> 25:53.880
If that's what you believe, then go.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.280
I won't fall for your shit.

25:55.920 --> 25:58.120
After all, you pledge to serve us
at the student council.

25:58.200 --> 26:01.160
We voted for you way before
you all voted for me. So go serve us!

26:01.240 --> 26:03.080
-[Kaew] Fuck you! Let me in!
-[doorknob clanking]

26:03.680 --> 26:05.000
[Koh] You should go now

26:05.080 --> 26:06.560
before the murderer comes back.

26:07.560 --> 26:08.680
What's wrong?

26:09.320 --> 26:10.400
Do you want to join her?

26:10.960 --> 26:12.720
What a gentleman, pushing a girl outside.

26:12.800 --> 26:13.640
[Kaew] Koh, fuck you!

26:13.720 --> 26:16.880
I'm more of a gentleman than you.
You sad excuse for an adult.

26:32.280 --> 26:34.680
[phone rings]

26:34.760 --> 26:36.160
[Suer] Is someone calling you?

26:36.240 --> 26:37.920
[ringing continues]

26:39.600 --> 26:41.600
It's Kaew. She's video-calling me.

26:43.200 --> 26:44.760
The reception is really bad.

26:46.720 --> 26:48.960
[breathing heavily]

26:51.800 --> 26:52.840
Kaew!

26:55.680 --> 26:56.640
Kaew!

26:57.960 --> 27:00.120
-Hello.
-[Boong] Kaew.

27:00.200 --> 27:01.960
What should we do? She can't hear us.

27:06.520 --> 27:07.600
[Kaew] Boong.

27:07.680 --> 27:10.160
-Boong.
-[Boong] Kaew. Can you hear me now?

27:10.240 --> 27:11.160
It's…

27:13.640 --> 27:14.800
It's really dark out here

27:16.240 --> 27:17.960
and very, very quiet.

27:19.600 --> 27:20.760
I don't think

27:21.640 --> 27:23.640
anyone's in the school anymore.

27:24.120 --> 27:27.200
Kaew, leave through the front gate
and then call the police for help.

27:27.280 --> 27:29.160
That's what I'm doing right now.

27:29.760 --> 27:30.720
[Boong] What's wrong, Kaew?

27:32.080 --> 27:32.960
What's happening?

27:34.000 --> 27:36.240
-Kaew, get out of there.
-[Suer] What is it?

27:36.320 --> 27:37.560
You should leave. Go.

27:37.640 --> 27:39.600
It could be the murderer.
Get away from there!

27:39.680 --> 27:41.800
What if it's someone who can rescue me?

27:42.360 --> 27:45.280
Kaew, listen to me.
Leave now. Don't go in there!

27:47.720 --> 27:48.800
[Boong] Kaew!

27:50.200 --> 27:52.800
-It's so dangerous. Just leave.
-[Kaew] Fuck.

27:53.560 --> 27:55.080
What the fuck is this?

27:55.160 --> 27:56.520
[panting]

27:57.680 --> 27:59.480
It's dangerous. Just go.

27:59.560 --> 28:00.920
Okay, you just leave.

28:01.000 --> 28:01.960
Run!

28:02.440 --> 28:04.120
-[Suer] Shit.
-[Koh] Kaew, why are you running away?

28:04.200 --> 28:05.880
-Shit.
-Why aren't you going for help?

28:06.360 --> 28:08.600
[Kaew] Fuck you, Koh. Shut the fuck up!

28:08.680 --> 28:10.120
I'm out here because of you.

28:10.680 --> 28:13.880
This should be you, you fucking asshole!
This is all your fault!

28:13.960 --> 28:14.960
-Kaew.
-[Suer] Hey!

28:15.040 --> 28:17.560
-Kaew! Kaew!
-Get out of there!

28:17.640 --> 28:19.360
-[clattering]
-[Suer] No.

28:19.440 --> 28:21.040
[breathing heavily]

28:21.120 --> 28:22.240
It hanged up.

28:23.520 --> 28:24.840
[sobbing]

28:26.360 --> 28:27.680
It hanged up on me.

28:28.440 --> 28:29.800
What should we do now?

28:34.960 --> 28:35.960
What?

28:36.040 --> 28:38.680
This is your fault.
You pushed Kaew out there.

28:38.760 --> 28:41.720
You all were forcing me to go,
but I didn't want to.

28:41.800 --> 28:43.120
[Tor] But I agree.

28:43.680 --> 28:46.160
If someone should go and find Kaew,
it should be Koh.

28:47.360 --> 28:48.480
[Suer] I agree.

28:49.920 --> 28:51.160
But I think that…

29:01.440 --> 29:04.120
Fine. You win. I'll go.

29:04.600 --> 29:06.920
Being here is worse
than anything out there.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.480
[desk clatters]

29:17.720 --> 29:19.680
[door clanks]

29:30.000 --> 29:31.320
Tang. Tang.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.000
All right.

29:35.800 --> 29:37.560
I'm not so sure that

29:38.280 --> 29:40.280
Koh is gonna be of any help here.

29:41.360 --> 29:42.880
What if he just takes off?

29:43.600 --> 29:44.480
Oh.

29:44.560 --> 29:45.920
Koh is not like that at all.

29:46.960 --> 29:48.800
He will definitely go and help Kaew.

29:52.280 --> 29:53.800
You've stuck up for Koh

29:55.120 --> 29:56.720
so many times now.

29:58.120 --> 29:59.960
Why are you so worried about him? Tell me.

30:00.640 --> 30:01.840
It's not like that.

30:03.000 --> 30:05.120
I just don't want people to misjudge him.

30:06.760 --> 30:08.760
If you don't believe
that Koh went to help Kaew,

30:08.840 --> 30:10.400
then why don't you try calling him?

30:13.480 --> 30:17.560
[phone ringing]

30:21.440 --> 30:22.680
[busy tone]

30:22.760 --> 30:24.560
[sighs]
No answer.

30:28.600 --> 30:29.600
[sighs]

30:34.720 --> 30:36.000
[phone ringing]

30:36.480 --> 30:37.920
-[Koh] Hello?
-Koh, you answered.

30:38.400 --> 30:41.520
[Koh] I came out here to look for Kaew
but I can't find her.

30:42.320 --> 30:43.480
[Sa] You see?

30:43.560 --> 30:45.520
I told you that Koh isn't like that.

30:49.120 --> 30:51.800
Since you're out there, why don't you go

30:52.960 --> 30:54.840
and see if you can find somebody
to help us?

30:55.520 --> 30:58.600
[Koh] To be honest,
I don't wanna help anyone.

31:03.600 --> 31:05.280
Can you do it for me, then?

31:07.160 --> 31:08.480
Can you help me out?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.280
[Koh] Fine.

31:13.240 --> 31:15.640
I'll figure something out. I gotta go now.

31:18.200 --> 31:20.280
Help is on the way, okay?

31:25.280 --> 31:26.400
Excuse me.

31:28.240 --> 31:29.880
You can't go out there right now.

31:32.480 --> 31:33.840
Do you want me to pee in here?

31:37.000 --> 31:38.800
Koh has gone to get help.

31:39.400 --> 31:40.640
Just be patient.

31:40.720 --> 31:42.360
I think you should wait here

31:42.840 --> 31:44.280
in case the killer is nearby.

31:44.960 --> 31:48.360
If she forces her way in here,
you and I can protect the others.

31:50.200 --> 31:51.520
You're a strong man.

31:52.680 --> 31:54.280
You can protect everyone.

31:55.800 --> 31:57.000
Bye.

31:57.080 --> 31:59.080
-Uh…
-Suer.

31:59.680 --> 32:00.880
[Suer grunts]

32:06.000 --> 32:07.000
[breathing heavily]

32:23.520 --> 32:25.200
[Sa] Can anyone else
get through to anyone?

32:25.280 --> 32:26.280
[Tor coughs]

32:29.000 --> 32:30.400
Come and sit down, Sa.

32:34.000 --> 32:35.920
[breathing heavily]

32:42.480 --> 32:43.680
What do you want?

32:44.760 --> 32:45.920
Nothing.

32:48.240 --> 32:49.520
Just say what's on your mind.

32:52.240 --> 32:54.320
If we do get out of here, then…

32:55.440 --> 32:57.480
there'll probably be an investigation

32:57.560 --> 32:59.280
in to the girl who died in the hallway.

33:03.240 --> 33:04.680
I did it to protect all of you.

33:05.240 --> 33:06.360
Everyone knows.

33:06.880 --> 33:08.480
[Nanno] Everyone in here does.

33:08.560 --> 33:09.840
But Koh…

33:12.120 --> 33:14.640
If Koh manages to finds help for us,

33:15.520 --> 33:17.440
everyone will consider him a hero.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.600
People will be more likely

33:20.760 --> 33:22.120
to listen to him

33:22.680 --> 33:23.560
than to you,

33:24.640 --> 33:27.760
Suer, Kaew, Sa,

33:27.840 --> 33:29.840
Duang, or Boong.

33:30.920 --> 33:33.440
What kind of father
do you think Tang wants to have?

33:34.360 --> 33:36.320
A father who kept everyone safe

33:36.800 --> 33:38.760
but is known to be a murderer,

33:39.880 --> 33:41.600
or a father who was a hero

33:42.560 --> 33:44.280
because he saved us all?

34:06.360 --> 34:07.360
[Tor] Tang.

34:10.120 --> 34:11.560
Daddy's gonna go find help.

34:12.760 --> 34:14.320
I need you to stay here with them.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.440
[Tang] No.

34:20.320 --> 34:23.600
But, sir, what if the killer comes in?

34:25.000 --> 34:26.480
You girls will find a way.

34:27.280 --> 34:28.440
You will.

34:28.520 --> 34:29.840
But, Dad…

34:29.920 --> 34:31.600
I have to leave you here, Tang.

34:35.719 --> 34:36.719
Come on.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.480
Sa…

34:56.280 --> 34:57.480
lock the door.

35:13.400 --> 35:14.600
[door lock clicks]

35:23.520 --> 35:25.600
How come you had to say that to him?

35:26.520 --> 35:29.520
Don't you know how scary it is
for us to be left alone?

35:30.720 --> 35:31.800
How scary is it?

35:32.400 --> 35:34.360
We have no weapons to defend ourselves.

35:35.120 --> 35:36.560
If something happens…

35:38.560 --> 35:39.640
You're smiling?

35:40.200 --> 35:42.440
[laughs]

35:47.560 --> 35:48.680
Come over here.

35:49.280 --> 35:51.680
Do you remember when she showed us
the picture of the murderer?

35:51.760 --> 35:53.840
She had the exact same haircut as Nanno.

35:54.680 --> 35:55.640
[Duang] Oh, no.

35:56.120 --> 35:58.360
And she lured all of the guys out--

35:58.440 --> 36:01.640
[laughing]

36:04.840 --> 36:07.120
It's you, right? You're the killer!

36:15.280 --> 36:16.920
Is that what you girls think?

36:18.120 --> 36:19.520
Why were you laughing?

36:19.600 --> 36:21.520
You admit that you're her by laughing.

36:22.240 --> 36:24.080
How could I not laugh at you?

36:25.040 --> 36:27.240
You girls think
that I'm some psycho killer

36:27.800 --> 36:29.800
even though I was with you

36:31.280 --> 36:32.880
when the killing first started.

36:33.560 --> 36:34.800
And, Boong,

36:35.280 --> 36:38.000
didn't you say that
you saw the so-called murderer?

36:38.760 --> 36:41.360
It's true, I did see her,
but I didn't see her clearly.

36:41.440 --> 36:43.120
It could have been you. Isn't that right?

36:44.280 --> 36:46.680
Didn't someone get stabbed out
in the hallway

36:46.760 --> 36:49.680
when this lady
was inside the room here with us?

36:49.760 --> 36:50.880
[claps]

36:51.880 --> 36:53.240
Great, Tang.

36:53.320 --> 36:55.320
You're smarter than all of them together.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.960
Why are you playing
with the box cutter, then?

36:58.040 --> 36:59.000
[Nanno] No reason.

37:00.360 --> 37:04.280
I just wanna make sure
that it works just fine

37:04.960 --> 37:06.640
in case I need to use it on someone.

37:09.640 --> 37:11.680
[footsteps in distance]

37:13.320 --> 37:16.360
-Shit. Is that the killer?
-Shh. Shut up.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.520
[male student screams]

37:21.040 --> 37:22.160
Is that Koh?

37:23.520 --> 37:25.080
We should go and help him.

37:25.160 --> 37:26.480
Come on.

37:27.080 --> 37:29.320
Suer left a long time ago
but all you care about is Koh.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.720
My boyfriend isn't screaming.

37:32.560 --> 37:34.720
If it was Suer,
I would go and help him, too.

37:34.800 --> 37:36.440
-Come on. Let's go.
-[Duang] Wait.

37:37.000 --> 37:38.920
Are you crazy? I'm staying.

37:39.000 --> 37:41.120
You can go by yourself if you want to.

37:42.000 --> 37:45.000
I wanna go with you. I wanna find my dad.

37:46.280 --> 37:48.240
-Come on.
-I'll go with you then.

37:49.520 --> 37:50.720
Hey, Boong.

37:50.800 --> 37:53.040
Please don't go.
Someone will come for us soon.

37:53.120 --> 37:55.120
You still think that someone
will come for us?

37:56.080 --> 37:59.800
As long as this kid is with us,
Mr. Tor will come back for her for sure.

37:59.880 --> 38:02.560
The kid just said
she wants to find her dad.

38:02.640 --> 38:05.320
[Tang] Let's go. I'm worried about my dad.

38:05.800 --> 38:08.400
If you wanna stay, then stay.
I'm out of here.

38:08.480 --> 38:10.240
Can you not put pressure on me like that?

38:10.320 --> 38:12.400
I don't wanna stay here
with this new girl.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.400
Who said I was staying with you?

38:15.320 --> 38:16.680
I'm going with them.

38:17.240 --> 38:19.920
It's better for us to stick together.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.840
At least one of you

38:22.400 --> 38:25.720
will be the bait for the murderer
so I can run to safety.

38:28.120 --> 38:29.560
Hey, Tang.

38:29.640 --> 38:32.200
What do you say, are you a big girl
who can be the bait?

38:33.160 --> 38:34.200
What are you saying?

38:35.320 --> 38:36.880
Nobody was thinking that.

38:37.360 --> 38:39.800
Is that so? Forgive me.

38:41.920 --> 38:42.960
[Duang] Wait.

38:44.680 --> 38:45.840
I'll go with you.

38:50.680 --> 38:53.240
[whispering]
Keep quiet. Keep quiet.

39:09.960 --> 39:12.320
Keep a lookout.
If you see something, say something.

39:12.880 --> 39:13.920
Okay.

39:20.000 --> 39:21.280
[Sa] What are you doing?

39:21.360 --> 39:23.680
I wanna take everyone to my dad.

39:30.560 --> 39:31.680
[Boong] Are you calling Koh?

39:34.560 --> 39:36.120
If he's with the murderer…

39:36.200 --> 39:37.400
We'll go and save him, right?

39:37.480 --> 39:38.960
[Boong] We'll know where to stay away.

39:42.320 --> 39:43.680
Why are you so awful?

39:44.800 --> 39:46.960
[Boong] Sacrifices have to be made.

39:47.040 --> 39:48.760
I'm thinking of ways to…

39:49.600 --> 39:51.440
to keep the rest of us alive.

39:53.520 --> 39:54.560
Boong is right.

39:54.640 --> 39:56.320
Koh might be our last hope.

39:56.400 --> 39:58.200
Hurry up and call him. Now.

39:58.680 --> 40:00.480
[Tang] My phone isn't working right.

40:01.680 --> 40:02.880
Mine's working.

40:05.400 --> 40:07.600
Where's Koh? We'll go the other way.

40:12.000 --> 40:13.200
He's over there.

40:14.760 --> 40:15.960
We'll go this way.

40:23.600 --> 40:24.600
Shit!

40:24.680 --> 40:25.520
Fuck.

40:27.120 --> 40:28.600
[panting]

40:39.440 --> 40:40.520
What's wrong?

40:41.000 --> 40:42.240
Ah, fuck.

40:42.320 --> 40:45.000
[Duang] Of course Sa
didn't take us to safety.

40:45.480 --> 40:47.080
She fucking brought us to Koh.

40:47.160 --> 40:48.560
-You bitch!
-That's not true.

40:49.520 --> 40:50.640
What is not true?

40:50.720 --> 40:52.400
I saw it. Let us look at it then.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.480
-[Sa] Let go!
-My phone!

40:55.600 --> 40:56.600
Let me see.

40:56.680 --> 40:57.640
No.

40:58.280 --> 41:01.080
You won't show us because
you're taking us to Koh, aren't you?

41:03.000 --> 41:04.360
You guys are so selfish.

41:04.920 --> 41:06.320
You only care about yourselves.

41:07.120 --> 41:09.000
[Duang] You will get us all killed,
you know?

41:11.520 --> 41:12.720
You can go alone.

41:23.840 --> 41:25.840
[ominous music]

41:34.840 --> 41:36.680
-Hey, Sa, watch out!
-[screams]

41:37.160 --> 41:38.760
[sobbing]

41:40.520 --> 41:41.480
[Sa, Duang, Boong] Kaew!

41:41.560 --> 41:42.600
[gasps]

41:42.680 --> 41:43.520
[Kaew] Sa.

41:44.960 --> 41:46.800
-What happened?
-You need to help.

41:48.120 --> 41:49.160
[Sa] Why?

41:50.200 --> 41:51.280
It's Koh.

41:51.760 --> 41:54.000
-What's wrong with Koh?
-It's Koh!

41:54.680 --> 41:56.680
[foreboding music]

42:08.840 --> 42:12.320
[all screaming]

42:12.880 --> 42:14.200
[Tor] Tang! Tang! Tang!

42:14.760 --> 42:17.280
What… Sa! Are you all right? Sa!
[gasps]

42:17.880 --> 42:19.520
[sobbing]

42:20.040 --> 42:20.960
What happened?

42:21.040 --> 42:22.760
[Suer] Police. Call the police now!

42:22.840 --> 42:24.560
-[Tor] What happened?
-[Suer] Sa.

42:25.080 --> 42:27.560
The prisoner killed Koh.
[sobs]

42:27.640 --> 42:29.600
-[girls whimpering]
-Oh, my god.

42:30.120 --> 42:31.600
[Tor] Whoever did this is a monster.

42:31.680 --> 42:33.280
What should we do?

42:33.360 --> 42:34.360
[Tor] Are you all right?

42:34.440 --> 42:35.800
[girls crying]

42:39.080 --> 42:41.760
[reporter] This evening, a serial killer
who was previously convicted 

42:41.840 --> 42:44.160
of killing eight students
broke out of prison and returned

42:44.240 --> 42:47.040
to the scene of the crime carrying out
yet another vicious attack.

42:47.120 --> 42:50.240
The killer injured three students
before attempting to escape

42:50.320 --> 42:53.760
when they saw her fall to her death
from the roof of the school building.

42:53.840 --> 42:57.400
The campus has been under
police lockdown since late this evening.

42:57.480 --> 43:00.760
Are you telling us that the three students
who are found to be

43:00.840 --> 43:02.520
severely injured are okay now?

43:04.440 --> 43:05.560
They are fine.

43:06.280 --> 43:07.760
[reporter] That is all we know so far.

43:07.840 --> 43:09.480
-[Tor] What?
-[reporter] We will continue to update…

43:09.560 --> 43:10.760
How is that possible?

43:11.320 --> 43:13.760
Didn't a student die outside
of our classroom?

43:15.680 --> 43:16.640
What?

43:18.400 --> 43:19.560
We thought you were dead.

43:20.360 --> 43:22.120
I… I had an asthma attack.

43:22.200 --> 43:24.720
I tend to faint
when I'm in an intense situations.

43:31.160 --> 43:32.240
Well…

43:32.760 --> 43:34.160
if that's the case,

43:34.640 --> 43:36.120
then I wonder who…

43:36.680 --> 43:38.280
ended up killing Koh?

43:39.600 --> 43:40.840
Hmm…

43:45.360 --> 43:49.000
Suer was totally overcome with jealousy.

43:49.080 --> 43:50.560
-[Koh screams]
-[grunts]

43:51.880 --> 43:56.760
Perhaps Tor didn't want Koh to tell people
what happened in the classroom.

43:57.480 --> 43:59.440
[Tor grunts]

44:01.280 --> 44:05.680
Or it could have been Kaew who was angry
with Koh for pushing her out of the room.

44:06.720 --> 44:08.920
[Kaew screams]

44:09.480 --> 44:10.960
In all honesty,

44:11.040 --> 44:12.800
if it weren't for Tang here,

44:12.880 --> 44:15.880
the three of you would have ganged up
and killed me by now, wouldn't you?

44:15.960 --> 44:17.080
What?

44:17.160 --> 44:18.440
Forget about it.

44:19.080 --> 44:20.880
The real mystery remains.

44:20.960 --> 44:23.040
What are we gonna do with Koh?

44:23.120 --> 44:25.200
I'll let you geniuses decide.

44:26.120 --> 44:27.600
Let's go, Tang.

44:28.200 --> 44:30.320
How about we go and find Duang's phone?

44:31.080 --> 44:33.040
I saw it fall into the drain.

44:33.600 --> 44:36.400
We could really use
your small hands to get it out.

44:55.680 --> 44:57.320
Can you get it for me, please?

44:57.920 --> 44:59.640
This phone is very important.

45:04.040 --> 45:06.160
Why is it so important to you?

45:07.120 --> 45:08.760
The phone isn't even yours.

45:09.240 --> 45:10.280
Hmm…

45:11.280 --> 45:14.760
That phone recorded everything
that happened in the classroom.

45:14.840 --> 45:16.800
It will be a key piece of evidence

45:17.280 --> 45:19.640
that will be used to find who killed Koh

45:19.720 --> 45:23.840
and the people who willingly let him die,
like your father for example.

45:26.680 --> 45:29.560
So, can you please get it for me?

45:31.880 --> 45:34.400
I can't reach it. It's too deep.

45:40.080 --> 45:41.120
Sweet Tang.

45:41.880 --> 45:43.480
[Nanno] You're such a good daughter.

45:44.880 --> 45:47.200
You'll have a bright future
at this school.

45:47.920 --> 45:49.720
You're just like anyone of us.

45:51.640 --> 45:55.320
[Nanno laughs maniacally]

45:57.960 --> 45:59.840
[maniacal laugh continues]

45:59.920 --> 46:01.920
[closing theme music]
